  "slug": "executive-summary",
  "pdfPages": [
    5,
    7
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "This capstone asks how a set of African founders have used capital as a strategic tool, and what founders and investors can learn from their financing decisions. It is an exploratory, qualitative comparison of nine fintech and logistics companies across East, North and West Africa, based on public sources, and assesses each against seven dimensions: funding timing, instrument choice, investor selection, dilution management, follow-on funding, debt versus equity, and decisions to decline or delay capital.",
      "lead": true
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The sample comprises five scaled companies (M-KOPA, MNT-Halan, NALA, Moniepoint and LemFi), three early-stage companies (Autogirl, Feegor and Earthbond) and one cautionary case (Sendy), read alongside Moove’s 2026 exit from Nigeria. The sample is purposive, not representative, and the findings are patterns to test rather than causal laws."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Across the cases, one question recurs: who carries the asset and its risk. The answer is closely associated with how much capital a company needs, how flexibly it can finance itself and how exposed it is to funding shocks, although the sample cannot show that it caused those outcomes. M-KOPA finances customer devices with debt and reserves equity mainly for its platform, extending about $1.5B of credit by 2024 on roughly $245M of equity raised by 2023. MNT-Halan funds its Egyptian-pound loan book largely through local-currency securitisation. Moniepoint, a licensed microfinance bank, has raised over $280M of equity and can fund lending from deposits. NALA and LemFi built their core payments businesses on equity, and both have since moved toward debt-related activity: NALA through a 2026 credit facility to pre-fund payment corridors, LemFi through its 2025 acquisition of credit-scoring business Pillar. Autogirl, Feegor and Earthbond reached the market on small sums by leaving vehicles, delivery and loans with partners."
    },
    {
      "type": "quote",
      "text": "The findings are patterns to test rather than causal laws."
    },
    {
      "type": "h",
      "id": "four-findings-stand-out",
      "title": "Four findings stand out",
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "items",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "1",
          "title": "Who owns and finances the asset shapes the capital strategy",
          "text": "Its effect depends on cash-flow predictability, lender availability, currency, the contractual allocation of risk and dependence on any single platform or partner. Sendy, which added fulfilment and supply lines funded largely with equity before closing in 2023, and Moove, whose Nigerian vehicle finance was linked to ride-hailing earnings, illustrate the downside; neither outcome has a single cause.",
          "accent": "#F2766B"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "title": "Partners first, then the balance sheet",
          "text": "Several founders left risk with partners until they could price it, then financed assets directly once data and lenders were available; this is a context-dependent heuristic, not a universal progression.",
          "accent": "#0E8577"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "title": "Raising from strength",
          "text": "Founders who raised from strength, such as NALA after reaching profitability, attracted strong syndicates in weak markets, although the terms they obtained are rarely public.",
          "accent": "#5B21E6"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "title": "Investor selection tracked the stage",
          "text": "Investor selection tracked each stage’s capital need, the customers’ market and the intended exit.",
          "accent": "#16132B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The paper closes with an African Founder Capital-Strategy Framework: a sequence of questions on what is being financed, who should own the asset and carry its risks, which instrument fits, what conditions must hold first, and what happens if a lender, platform or partner relationship changes. The framework separates whether an instrument suits a business in principle from whether it is available and economic in a given market."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "For founders, the practical implication is to diagnose the asset before sizing the raise. For investors, it is to underwrite the capital structure and the contracts that transfer risk, not only the company. The evidence base is uneven: dilution is rarely disclosed, debt terms are seldom public, several figures rest on press reports and founder statements, and three cases are too early for their outcomes to be judged."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "number": 2,
      "title": null,
      "html": "<div class=\"lb\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px\">The sequence, as the cases show it</div>\n<svg aria-label=\"Sequence: leave the asset with a partner while risk cannot be priced, then own the asset and fund it with debt once repayment data exists. Funding owned assets with equity, or with debt repaid through one outside platform, is the failure route.\" height=\"134\" role=\"img\" viewbox=\"0 0 682 190\" width=\"682\">\n<defs>\n<pattern height=\"7\" id=\"P06-s6t\" patterntransform=\"rotate(-45)\" patternunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"7\"><rect fill=\"#DDF1EE\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\"></rect><line stroke=\"#0E8577\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"7\"></line></pattern>\n<pattern height=\"7\" id=\"P06-s6o\" patterntransform=\"rotate(-45)\" patternunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"7\"><rect fill=\"#FDE6E3\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\"></rect><line stroke=\"#D4503F\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"7\"></line></pattern>\n<pattern height=\"7\" id=\"P06-s6r\" patterntransform=\"rotate(45)\" patternunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"7\"><rect fill=\"#F6DDE4\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\"></rect><line stroke=\"#A3123A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"7\"></line></pattern>\n<marker id=\"P06-s6a\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"6\" refy=\"5\"><path d=\"M0 0 L10 5 L0 10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></marker>\n</defs>\n<rect fill=\"#D3EFEA\" height=\"84\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"250\" x=\"4\" y=\"20\"></rect>\n<rect fill=\"#FDDDD7\" height=\"84\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"274\" x=\"404\" y=\"20\"></rect>\n<path d=\"M262 62 C 310 52, 350 52, 396 62\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#P06-s6a)\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<rect fill=\"#FFFFFF\" height=\"56\" opacity=\".93\" width=\"222\" x=\"18\" y=\"34\"></rect>\n<rect fill=\"#FFFFFF\" height=\"56\" opacity=\".93\" width=\"246\" x=\"418\" y=\"34\"></rect>\n<g fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\">\n<text font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" x=\"30\" y=\"56\">Leave it with a partner</text>\n<text font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"500\" x=\"30\" y=\"77\">Autogirl · Feegor · Earthbond</text>\n<text font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" x=\"430\" y=\"56\">Own it: debt or deposits</text>\n<text font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"500\" x=\"430\" y=\"77\">M-KOPA · MNT-Halan · Moniepoint</text>\n</g>\n<text fill=\"#5B21E6\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"13.6\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"329\" y=\"94\">once they can</text>\n<text fill=\"#5B21E6\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"13.6\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"329\" y=\"112\">price the risk</text>\n<rect fill=\"#F6DDE4\" height=\"54\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#A3123A\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"360\" x=\"160\" y=\"128\"></rect>\n<rect fill=\"#FFFFFF\" height=\"34\" opacity=\".93\" width=\"336\" x=\"172\" y=\"138\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"340\" y=\"153\">Asset-intensive lines funded with equity, or</text>\n<text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"340\" y=\"168\">debt linked to one outside platform</text>\n<text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"14.4\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"600\" x=\"530\" y=\"160\">the downside:</text>\n<text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"14.4\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"600\" x=\"530\" y=\"178\">Sendy, Moove</text>\n</svg>",
      "board": "P06",
      "caption": "Findings one and two in one picture: a context-dependent heuristic, not a universal progression. NALA and LemFi built their core payments businesses on equity. Source: Sections 04–06.",
      "alt": "Sequence: leave the asset with a partner while risk cannot be priced, then own the asset and fund it with debt once repayment data exists. Funding owned assets with equity, or with debt repaid through one outside platform, is the failure route."
    },
    {
      "type": "label",
      "text": "The main point in one picture"
    },
    {
      "type": "h",
      "id": "how-the-asset-and-its-risk-move",
      "title": "How the asset and its risk move",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Every case in this study turns on the same question: when a business needs vehicles, stock, devices, float or loans, which party holds the asset and which carries its risk. The four arrangements below summarise the answers the cases give. Each is a simplification: the precise split of risk depends on contracts and facility terms, which are rarely public."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "number": 3,
      "title": null,
      "html": "<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:8px\">\n<div style=\"border:1.5px solid #16132B;border-radius:12px;background:#FFFFFF;overflow:hidden\">\n<div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DED2;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px\"><span style=\"font:800 12.5px/1.2 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif\"><span class=\"rc\" style=\"background:#0E8577\"></span>Leave it with a partner</span><span style=\"font:600 9px/1.2 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A4660;text-align:right\">Autogirl · Feegor · Earthbond</span></div>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"196\" style=\"display:block\" viewbox=\"0 0 328 196\" width=\"328\"><defs><marker id=\"P06b-ah\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\"><path d=\"M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z\" fill=\"#16132B\"></path></marker><marker id=\"P06b-ahr\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\"><path d=\"M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z\" fill=\"#A3123A\"></path></marker></defs><rect fill=\"#FFFFFF\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"124\" x=\"102\" y=\"14\"></rect><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"164\" y=\"33\">Startup</text><text fill=\"#4A4660\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"164\" y=\"46\">platform and contracts</text><rect fill=\"#FFFFFF\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"124\" x=\"14\" y=\"136\"></rect><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"76\" y=\"155\">Partner</text><text fill=\"#4A4660\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"76\" y=\"168\">owner, 3PL or lender</text><rect fill=\"#F1EEF6\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#C9C4D6\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"124\" x=\"190\" y=\"136\"></rect><text fill=\"#9A95A8\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"252\" y=\"155\">Lender</text><text fill=\"#ABA6B8\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"252\" y=\"168\">funds the partner, if any</text><rect fill=\"#0E8577\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" width=\"18\" x=\"117\" y=\"121\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"126\" y=\"133.5\">A</text><path d=\"M148 121 L157 137 L139 137 Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#A3123A\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path><text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"148\" y=\"135\">!</text><line marker-end=\"url(#P06b-ahr)\" stroke=\"#A3123A\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" x1=\"112\" x2=\"76\" y1=\"54\" y2=\"134\"></line><text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" x=\"12\" y=\"84\">risk passed</text><text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" x=\"12\" y=\"96\">by contract</text><line marker-end=\"url(#P06b-ah)\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" x1=\"110\" x2=\"152\" y1=\"134\" y2=\"58\"></line><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" x=\"150\" y=\"104\">fee or margin share</text><line marker-end=\"url(#P06b-ah)\" stroke=\"#C9C4D6\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" x1=\"190\" x2=\"142\" y1=\"156\" y2=\"156\"></line></svg>\n<div style=\"padding:0 12px 10px;font:500 10px/1.4 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:#2A2640\">Car owners, logistics firms or partner banks hold the asset. The startup runs the platform and earns a fee; insurance, escrow and guarantors move the risk, but only if they are enforced.</div></div>\n<div style=\"border:1.5px solid #16132B;border-radius:12px;background:#FFFFFF;overflow:hidden\">\n<div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DED2;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px\"><span style=\"font:800 12.5px/1.2 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif\"><span class=\"rc\" style=\"background:#F2766B\"></span>Own it, fund it with debt</span><span style=\"font:600 9px/1.2 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A4660;text-align:right\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">M-KOPA</span> · <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">MNT-Halan</span> · NALA (float)</span></div>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"196\" style=\"display:block\" viewbox=\"0 0 328 196\" width=\"328\"><defs><marker id=\"P06b-ah\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\"><path d=\"M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z\" fill=\"#16132B\"></path></marker><marker id=\"P06b-ahr\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\"><path d=\"M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z\" fill=\"#A3123A\"></path></marker></defs><rect fill=\"#FFFFFF\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"124\" x=\"102\" y=\"14\"></rect><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"164\" y=\"33\">Startup</text><text fill=\"#4A4660\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"164\" y=\"46\">holds the asset</text><rect fill=\"#F1EEF6\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#C9C4D6\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"124\" x=\"14\" y=\"136\"></rect><text fill=\"#9A95A8\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"76\" y=\"155\">Partner</text><text fill=\"#ABA6B8\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"76\" y=\"168\">agents, distribution</text><rect fill=\"#FFFFFF\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"124\" x=\"190\" y=\"136\"></rect><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"252\" y=\"155\">Lender</text><text fill=\"#4A4660\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"252\" y=\"168\">facility or securitisation</text><rect fill=\"#F2766B\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" width=\"18\" x=\"231\" y=\"23\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"240\" y=\"35.5\">A</text><path d=\"M262 23 L271 39 L253 39 Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#A3123A\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path><text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"262\" y=\"37\">!</text><line marker-end=\"url(#P06b-ah)\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" x1=\"240\" x2=\"196\" y1=\"134\" y2=\"58\"></line><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" x=\"232\" y=\"92\">funds</text><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" x=\"232\" y=\"104\">the asset</text><line marker-end=\"url(#P06b-ah)\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" x1=\"176\" x2=\"222\" y1=\"58\" y2=\"134\"></line><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"end\" x=\"150\" y=\"112\">repaid from</text><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"end\" x=\"150\" y=\"124\">collections</text><text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"164\" y=\"192\">the lender shares credit risk on the facility’s terms</text></svg>\n<div style=\"padding:0 12px 10px;font:500 10px/1.4 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:#2A2640\">The startup holds devices, loans or float and borrows against their cash flows. It works where repayments are small, frequent and observable; Moove shows the risk when repayment rests on one platform.</div></div>\n<div style=\"border:1.5px solid #16132B;border-radius:12px;background:#FFFFFF;overflow:hidden\">\n<div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DED2;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px\"><span style=\"font:800 12.5px/1.2 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif\"><span class=\"rc\" style=\"background:#2C64C7\"></span>Fund it from deposits</span><span style=\"font:600 9px/1.2 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A4660;text-align:right\">Moniepoint</span></div>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"196\" style=\"display:block\" viewbox=\"0 0 328 196\" width=\"328\"><defs><marker id=\"P06b-ah\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\"><path d=\"M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z\" fill=\"#16132B\"></path></marker><marker id=\"P06b-ahr\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\"><path d=\"M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z\" fill=\"#A3123A\"></path></marker></defs><rect fill=\"#FFFFFF\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"124\" x=\"102\" y=\"14\"></rect><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"164\" y=\"33\">Startup</text><text fill=\"#4A4660\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"164\" y=\"46\">licensed bank, holds loans</text><rect fill=\"#F1EEF6\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#C9C4D6\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"124\" x=\"14\" y=\"136\"></rect><text fill=\"#9A95A8\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"76\" y=\"155\">Partner</text><text fill=\"#ABA6B8\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"76\" y=\"168\">agents, merchants</text><rect fill=\"#FFFFFF\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"124\" x=\"190\" y=\"136\"></rect><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"252\" y=\"155\">Depositors</text><text fill=\"#4A4660\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"252\" y=\"168\">regulator supervises</text><rect fill=\"#2C64C7\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" width=\"18\" x=\"231\" y=\"23\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"240\" y=\"35.5\">A</text><path d=\"M262 23 L271 39 L253 39 Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#A3123A\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path><text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"262\" y=\"37\">!</text><line marker-end=\"url(#P06b-ah)\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" x1=\"240\" x2=\"196\" y1=\"134\" y2=\"58\"></line><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" x=\"232\" y=\"92\">deposits</text><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" x=\"232\" y=\"104\">fund lending</text><text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"164\" y=\"104\">credit risk held</text><text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"164\" y=\"116\">within prudential limits</text></svg>\n<div style=\"padding:0 12px 10px;font:500 10px/1.4 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:#2A2640\">A licensed bank lends from customer deposits. Supervision and capital requirements set how much risk it can hold.</div></div>\n<div style=\"border:1.5px solid #16132B;border-radius:12px;background:#FFFFFF;overflow:hidden\">\n<div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DED2;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px\"><span style=\"font:800 12.5px/1.2 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif\"><span class=\"rc\" style=\"background:#A3123A\"></span>Own it, fund it with equity</span><span style=\"font:600 9px/1.2 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A4660;text-align:right\">Sendy (cautionary)</span></div>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"196\" style=\"display:block\" viewbox=\"0 0 328 196\" width=\"328\"><defs><marker id=\"P06b-ah\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\"><path d=\"M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z\" fill=\"#16132B\"></path></marker><marker id=\"P06b-ahr\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\"><path d=\"M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z\" fill=\"#A3123A\"></path></marker></defs><rect fill=\"#FFFFFF\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"124\" x=\"102\" y=\"14\"></rect><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"164\" y=\"33\">Startup</text><text fill=\"#4A4660\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"164\" y=\"46\">holds the asset</text><rect fill=\"#F1EEF6\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#C9C4D6\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"124\" x=\"14\" y=\"136\"></rect><text fill=\"#9A95A8\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"76\" y=\"155\">Partner</text><text fill=\"#ABA6B8\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"76\" y=\"168\">none carries it</text><rect fill=\"#FFFFFF\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" width=\"124\" x=\"190\" y=\"136\"></rect><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"252\" y=\"155\">Shareholders</text><text fill=\"#4A4660\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"252\" y=\"168\">equity, no lender</text><rect fill=\"#A3123A\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" width=\"18\" x=\"231\" y=\"23\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"240\" y=\"35.5\">A</text><path d=\"M262 23 L271 39 L253 39 Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#A3123A\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path><text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"262\" y=\"37\">!</text><line marker-end=\"url(#P06b-ah)\" stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" x1=\"240\" x2=\"196\" y1=\"134\" y2=\"58\"></line><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" x=\"232\" y=\"92\">equity funds</text><text fill=\"#16132B\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" x=\"232\" y=\"104\">the asset</text><line marker-end=\"url(#P06b-ahr)\" stroke=\"#A3123A\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" x1=\"186\" x2=\"230\" y1=\"58\" y2=\"134\"></line><text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"end\" x=\"150\" y=\"112\">losses fall on</text><text fill=\"#A3123A\" font-family=\"Source Serif 4, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"end\" x=\"150\" y=\"124\">equity holders</text></svg>\n<div style=\"padding:0 12px 10px;font:500 10px/1.4 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:#2A2640\">The startup holds the asset and funds it with shareholders’ money. No lender shares the risk, and equity is usually the costliest way to fund an asset.</div></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0 0;font:600 10px/1 'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:#2A2640\">\n<span><svg height=\"16\" style=\"vertical-align:-4px\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"16\"><rect fill=\"#5B21E6\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" width=\"18\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></rect><text fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"9\" y=\"12.5\">A</text></svg> holds the asset (title)</span>\n<span><svg height=\"16\" style=\"vertical-align:-4px\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 18\" width=\"18\"><path d=\"M10 1 L19 17 L1 17 Z\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#A3123A\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg> carries the main asset risk</span>\n<span><svg height=\"8\" style=\"vertical-align:0\" viewbox=\"0 0 30 8\" width=\"30\"><line stroke=\"#16132B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"24\" y1=\"4\" y2=\"4\"></line><path d=\"M22 0 L30 4 L22 8 Z\" fill=\"#16132B\"></path></svg> money</span>\n<span><svg height=\"8\" style=\"vertical-align:0\" viewbox=\"0 0 30 8\" width=\"30\"><line stroke=\"#A3123A\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"24\" y1=\"4\" y2=\"4\"></line><path d=\"M22 0 L30 4 L22 8 Z\" fill=\"#A3123A\"></path></svg> risk</span>\n<span style=\"color:#9A95A8\">grey = no role in this route</span></div>",
      "board": "P06b",
      "caption": "Who holds the asset and who carries its risk under each route. NALA and LemFi’s core payments businesses need no financeable asset; NALA’s 2026 corridor facility funds its float with debt. Sources: Sections 04–07."
